Campaign Type: {{.CampaignTypeLabel}}
Campaign Type Goal: {{.CampaignTypeDescription}}
Description: {{.Description}}
Key Messages: {{.KeyMessages}}
Language: {{.Language}}

{{.BrandBlock}}

Date Range: {{.StartDate}} — {{.EndDate}} ({{.DayCount}} days)
{{- if .Batch}}

This request is one slice of a larger plan. Generate exactly {{.Batch.PostCount}} posts in this response — the JSON array must contain exactly {{.Batch.PostCount}} objects, no more, no fewer.

Within this batch, distribute posts as follows (counts are non-negotiable):
{{- range .Batch.PhaseCounts}}
  • Phase {{.Sequence}} "{{.PhaseName}}" (phaseId: "{{.PhaseID}}"): {{.Count}} posts
{{- end}}

Platform mix for this batch:
{{- range .Batch.PlatformCounts}}
